# Craft's materials may be cards in your graveyard (CR 702.167a-b): "an artifact card from your graveyard". Bot1's Black
# Lotus is sacrificed for the mana that casts Dire Flail, so it is an artifact card in Bot1's graveyard when the Flail
# crafts the same turn, beside the Moxen and the Sol Ring on the battlefield that could have been chosen instead. The
# Lotus is chosen and exiled from the graveyard with the Flail as the cost is paid; the Flail returns as Dire
# Blunderbuss.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Dire Flail
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

